window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Deep within the icy isolation of Alaska's scientific outposts, FBI Agent Sadie Price uncovers a chilling pattern of murders disguised as accidents. As she delves into a possible conspiracy of industrial espionage, she must outsmart a deranged killer before the endless Alaskan night claims her as its next victim.</b></p> <p>ONLY VENGEANCE (A Sadie Price FBI Suspense Thriller) is book #9 in a chilling new series by mystery and thriller author Rylie Dark, which begins with ONLY MURDER (book #1).</p> <p>Special Agent Sadie Price, a 29-year-old rising star in the FBI’s BAU unit, stuns her colleagues by requesting reassignment to the FBI’s remote Alaskan field office. Back in her home state, a place she vowed she would never return, Sadie, running from a secret in her recent past and back into her old one, finds herself facing her demons—including her sister’s unsolved murder—while assigned to hunt down a new serial killer.</p> <p>An action-packed story, the SADIE PRICE series is a riveting crime thriller, jammed with suspense, surprises and twists and turns that you won’t see coming. It will have you fall in love with a brilliant and scarred new character, while challenging you, amidst a barren landscape, to solve an impenetrable crime.</p> <p>Future books in the series are now available!</p>"; 
